WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:01.440
I WANT THEM ALL TO COME.

00:01.440 --> 00:03.240
I BELIEVE THE BEST WAY IN WHICH

00:03.240 --> 00:05.840
WE CAN DEMONSTRATE RESISTANCE IS

00:05.840 --> 00:09.160
NOT BENDING THE KNEE TO TYRANNY.

00:09.160 --> 00:10.600
TYRANNY IS WHEN YOU'RE TOO

00:10.600 --> 00:11.800
AFRAID TO LEAVE YOUR HOUSE ON

00:11.800 --> 00:13.280
THE SOUTH SIDE.

00:13.280 --> 00:15.840
AMERICANS FEAR CRIME, NOT ICE.

00:15.840 --> 00:17.520
ILLEGALS FEAR ICE, AND THEY

00:17.520 --> 00:19.840
SHOULD, ESPECIALLY NOW THAT GREG

00:19.840 --> 00:21.000
ABBOTT IS SENDING THE NATIONAL

00:21.000 --> 00:22.520
GUARD TO CHICAGO.

00:22.520 --> 00:24.240
FIRST ABBOTT BUSS BIDEN MIGRANTS

00:24.240 --> 00:25.880
INTO ILLINOIS TO MAKE BLUE STATES

00:25.880 --> 00:27.560
FEEL LIKE BORDER STATES.

00:27.560 --> 00:28.800
THAT KIND OF HELPED TRUMP WIN THE

00:28.800 --> 00:30.800
ELECTION AND NOW TRUMP SAYS,

00:30.800 --> 00:31.800
ABBOTT, CAN YOU SEND THE GUARD

00:31.800 --> 00:32.800
BACK TO PICK THEM UP AND TAKE

00:32.800 --> 00:33.800
THEM HOME?

00:33.800 --> 00:36.800
200 TROOPS ARE ROLLING IN AND

00:36.800 --> 00:38.040
PRITZER IS CALLING THEM THE N-WORD.

